:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Nono (Rare Cat)]].''
'''Nono''' (ノノ ''Nono'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Nono
|image = E 089.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 400¢ - 1580¢
}}

==Enemy==
Similar to [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesse]], Nono is barely even a threat at all. She has 2.6x more health than Celesse and deals triple the damage, but she has Single Target and a longer attack rate, making her very easy to deal with. Her money drop is also very rewarding considering her low stats.

==Strategy==
Use anything to defeat her, since she will most likely die in one hit anyway.

